Park still runs `08c087f4`. The release and probe jobs for `083dfa95` failed the Store migration integrity check. The checksum entry for `0047_directory_syncs.sql` now passes the existing local Store guard. The GPU freeze fix has local test evidence. [CI run](https://github.com/lince-social/lince/actions/runs/44768978417)

The 83 P Records supply the acceptance criteria. Each checkbox below produces one build receipt, test verdict, measurement, or decision about one change. Use the [development checkpoint](record:r_2KDK4ZZZJNBEK0J23TFNQAZF9Y) for earlier measurements and [Overhaul.md](Overhaul.md) for the 471 detailed coverage checks.

Run the smallest relevant case first. A shared run can close several boxes when its report proves each result. Save the first failure with its revision and exact case. Give the fix and the rerun their own boxes when a failure needs more work. A waiting build is a dependency; keep independent checks available. Preserve original acceptance criteria in the linked Records.

## Existing changes — one targeted check at a time

- [ ] [P83](record:r_11F5Q868V60YDH4M44A10ETC0V) Locate one remaining foreground blocking operation in the current ranked trace. Identify a safe off-thread ownership boundary.
  Start with the named wall-time and owner-CPU readings in the saved `08c087f4` worker trace. Check the live ownership boundary in source.

- [ ] [P120](record:r_5FDXR01ABJBD6FW36MWABGMPZQ) Replay one work update with a slug change. Verify one final projection and one upsert with the exact durable result.
- [ ] [P128](record:r_5ZXJ3Y0TZEG0T3PDAH61X596QJ) Stream ordered command output while typing. Verify lossless input, exact output and bounded retained history.
- [ ] [P84](record:r_7G4HJRCVP9TZW0S1XS934HDWPQ) Refresh one unchanged File Explorer listing. Verify row reuse and one sorted listing for the presentation wave.
- [ ] [P132](record:r_01Z5DC695MDHGNT51DPHKY2J3T) Audit sibling capture aliases across a privacy change. Verify shared classification work and fresh authorization before pixels are exported.
- [ ] [P133](record:r_3FWBA6PYBR86X5N7S5QN20Z1P8) Render the same diagram cold and concurrently. Verify exact pixels and shared font storage.
- [ ] [P89](record:r_2NZ5PKRV5EBGZ2GE75QJXDVTQK) Move an item between two clipped owners. Verify exact clipping and one traversal for the applicable owner.

