## Waiting for another build

- [ ] **Application artifact.** Verify the optimized Lince binary produced by CI includes the GPU freeze fix. The available local binary, `08c087f4`, predates it.
- [ ] **Measurement probe artifact.** Verify that the optimized Park probe matches the application revision. The available local probe is a debug build from `d5048aca-backlog-final`.
- [ ] **Install the candidate.** Use the saved shipment Command for the verified optimized release and retain its installation receipt. The local installation is still `08c087f4`.

### Live release and freeze

- [ ] **Live build identity.** Verify that the running Park executable uses the new optimized revision after installation. Record the full revision and profile.
- [ ] **Freeze replay.** Use Ghostty and normal agent activity on the new build. Check that the desktop stays interactive and that the GPU-completion panic is absent during the observed session.
- [ ] [P156](record:r_675XKW987Z53WQNE9T0F48XBPH) **Installed graphics loader.** Run the mandatory prepared case through automatic discovery. Confirm matching artifact identity, graphics setup and preservation of caller driver choices.

